[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふぅ。今ので最後だったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew. That was the last of them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひぇっ。あんなのが、わたしの背後にいたんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek... To think one of those was right behind me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人ともやるわね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two were amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへっ！\u3000伊達に危険な場所を\n調査してるわけじゃないからね～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe! Well, we don't investigate dangerous places for nothing, you know!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルトガーさん、ありがとうございます！\nわたし、助けていただいて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much, Rutger! You saved my life..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁな。魔物がたくさんいたんで、細かいことは\n気が付かなかったぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did I? There were so many monsters, I wasn't really paying attention."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぷぷっ。ホントは気が付いてた癖に？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pfft. You totally noticed, didn't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あぁ？\u3000",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まーた照れてるしぃ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww, are you getting embarrassed again?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どこがだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Am not."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、えっと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わぁ、すっかり元気そうじゃん！\u3000さっきまで\n弱ってたのに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, well! You're looking quite lively now! Weren't you exhausted just a moment ago?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てめえ魔物の群れに叩き込むぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keep it up and I'll throw you right into that monster horde."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃ～。こっわ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, scary~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの二人、仲いいのよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those two get along well, don't they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、仲間なんですから、\nきっといいんだと思いますけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well, they're teammates, so I'm sure they do..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや……ひょっとして仲悪いんじゃねぇか？\nぜんぜん気が合ってねぇぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I dunno... maybe they actually hate each other? They don't seem to get along at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "体調も良くなってホッとしたのだとは思いますよ。\nきっと険悪な仲ではないでしょう。恐らく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believe they're just relieved to be feeling better. I doubt their relationship is truly hostile. Probably."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その調子ならみんなと合流する前に、ちゃーんと\n手柄立てられるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At this rate, you'll be able to prove yourself before we meet up with the others!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁぁ！？\u3000てめえに言われなくてもなァ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!? I don't need you telling me that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]